--  TextMessage(SwitchesS01 = state - Setting AlliesS02 = state - Game StartedS03 = state - Start Loc RandomizerS04 = state - Checking victory conditionsS05 = event - T1 winsS06 = event - T2 winsS07 = message - T1 - Your team captured the flagS08 = message - T1 - Your flag was capturedS09 = message - T2 - Your flag was capturedS10 = message - T2 - Your team captured the flagS11 = message - T1 - Your flag has been takenS12 = message - T1 - Your team has the enemy flagS13 = message - T2 - Your team has the enemy flagS14 = message - T2 - Your flag has been takenS15 = message - T1 - Your flag was returnedS16 = message - T1 - Enemy flag was returnedS17 = message - T2 - Enemy flag was returnedS18 = message - T2 - Your flag was returnedS19 = state - T1 Flag GoneS20 = state - T2 Flag Gone)
--  TextMessage(LocationsXChar# = COPs for character class selection.XCharChange# = COP for changing character class.XCharSelect = Location of your civilian when choosing a character class.XCharProtected = Protected area.XForgeProtected = Protected area.XSpawn#Guard = Flags are forbidden here, as are enemy units.XSpawn# = The spawning points for team X.XSpawnV# = Virtual spawn points, mapped randomly to actual spawn points.XCat1Up = COP Teleporter, leads to XCat1Top.XCat1Down = COP Teleporter, leads to XCat1Bottom.XFlag = This region follows the flag so you can detect events near the flag.XFlagLoc = Location of flag at start of game and after flag captures.XFlagCOP = If the enemy flag is taken here, give points.XFlagGuard = Returning the flag within this area is considered goaltending,  and results in the offending unit being teleported to the nearby catwalk.ScoreFlare# = Regions for visual effects.)
--  TextMessage(NotesAll COPs are created by triggers so that they exist even if the corresponding player slot is not filled.)


if(preferences.RapidStratagusIDE == true) then
Load("RapidStratagusIDE/RSI_Functions.lua")
RSI_MapConfiguration()
end



